title: Coalition Disunity
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: (player_in_jxsi and jxsi_dissent >= 30) or (player_in_jxcat and jxcat_dissent >= 30) and unity_disunity_timer = 0
card-image: img/jxsi/unity.jpg
face-image: img/jxsi/unity.jpg
frequency: 200
tags: jxsi_party jxcat_party
on-arrival: {!
    Q.month_actions += 1;
    Q.unity_disunity_timer = 4;
    Q.parlament_current_ciu_relations = Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"];
!}
role: card-party

= Coalition Disunity

The National Unity list with [+ parlament_current_ciu +] [? if cup_in_jxsi or cup_in_jxcat and not player_party = "cup": and the CUP ?][? if player_party != "erc": and ERC ?]is, understandably, plagued with disagreements. While these are expected to an extent, our different party positions and relations seem to be reaching worrying thresholds. 

[? if parlament_current_ciu_relations < 55: [+ parlament_current_ciu +] is discontent with recent [? if jxsi_formed and not jxcat_formed: jxsi?][? if jxcat_formed: jxcat?] course of action. ?]
[? if erc_relations < 55 and not player_party = "erc": ERC is quite unhappy with the direction the coalition has taken.  ?]
[? if cup_relations < 55 and (cup_in_jxsi or cup_in_jxcat) and not player_party = "cup": The CUP is complaining about us betraying the original ideas of the coalition. ?]

Something must be done for this coalition to survive.

- @concessions_ciu
- @concessions_erc
- @concessions_cup
- @do_nothing
- @breakup_jxsi
- @breakup_jxcat
- @easy_discard

@concessions_ciu
title: Give concessions to the [+ parlament_current_ciu +]
view-if: player_party != parlament_current_ciu and parlament_current_ciu_relations < 55
on-arrival: {!
    Q.erc_relations -= 2;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] += 8;
    if (Q.cup_in_jxsi || Q.cup_in_jxcat) {
        Q.cup_relations -= 5;
    } else {
        Q.cup_relations -= 2;
    }
!}

We have promised to pursue a more moderate agenda.

@concessions_erc
title: Give concessions to the ERC
view-if: player_party != "erc" and cup_relations < 55
on-arrival: {!
    Q.erc_relations += 8;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] -= 3;
    if (Q.cup_in_jxsi || Q.cup_in_jxcat) {
        Q.cup_relations -= 3;
    }
!}

We have promised to pursue a more leftist agenda, and to listen closely to popular demands.

@concessions_cup
title: Give concessions to the CUP
view-if: player_party != "cup" and cup_relations < 55
on-arrival: {!
    Q.cup_relations += 8;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] -= 5;
    Q.erc_relations -= 2;
!}

We have promised to pursue a more leftist agenda, and to listen closely to popular demands.

@do_nothing
title: There is nothing we can do, so is the nature of such a coalition
on-arrival: {!
    Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] -= 1;
    Q.erc_relations -= 1;
    if (Q.cup_in_jxsi || Q.cup_in_jxcat) {
        Q.cup_relations -= 1;
    }
!}

Maybe more arguing builds character?

@breakup_jxsi
title: Enough with National Unity!
subtitle: We will put an end to the jxsi coalition
view-if: player_in_jxsi
on-arrival: {!
    Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] -= 20;
    Q.erc_relations -= 20;
    if (Q.cup_in_jxsi) {
        Q.cup_relations -= 20;
    }
    Q.jxsi_dissolution_trigger = true;

    // TODO: more heavy penalities for CONCRETELY the PARTY that presses this button!
!}

Our party has taken the decision to leave the jxsi coalition. There's no going back now.

@breakup_jxcat
title: Enough with National Unity!
subtitle: We will put an end to the jxcat coalition
view-if: player_in_jxcat
on-arrival: {!
    Q.jxcat_dissolution_trigger = true;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] -= 20;
    Q.erc_relations -= 20;
    if (Q.cup_in_jxcat) {
        Q.cup_relations -= 20;
    }
!}

Our party has taken the decision to leave the jxcat coalition. There's no going back now.
